  "description": "My first solo holiday with PMB. Mind blown, but with him being out the game due to some plague, it really turned into a solo degenerative holiday, complimented with just as much running as degeneration. It is true, running really is the best way to see a city. I covered around eleven-to-twelve miles a day on my morning sober-upper runs, and actually feel like I have covered more than enough inner city, industrial district, and suburb. Enough to stick a big checkmark on the city. I place it much higher than walking or cycling when exploring, as you can pretty much stop wherever you want, doing whatever you want, far more than you could when tethered to a bicycle. All while still covering a hell of a lot more distance than you could on foot walking. Each day was pretty routine: long run exploration, shopping, cafés, dinner, then Copenhagen downtown to get messed up over some karaoke and hostel degeneration. I also could not have asked for a more convenient delay to the return flight. Meant we could watch all of the The Circus Live from the Etihad Stadium, Manchester, 2026 Amazon Music stream in the airport.",
